# Claude Code (agent state / transcripts — never commit),
# EXCEPT the repo-root .claude/ — that is the committed sdd harness
# (agents/skills/workflows/probes + CALIBRATION.md + CLAUDE.md), not agent state.
**/.claude/
!/.claude/
CLAUDE.md
!/.claude/CLAUDE.md

# sdd run evidence (ephemeral; distilled into <crate>/doc/verification/)
runs/

# bare `verus` invocations emit this into cwd
liblib.rlib

# Verus SMT solver traces (local debugging artifact, machine-specific)
.verus-solver-log/
